<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the Appendix, we provide additional information including dataset, baselines, model and training details, and the proof of Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1. ‣ 3.1 Method ‣ 3 DiSF: Diversified File Selection ‣ Combatting Dimensional Collapse in LLM Pre-Training Data via Diversified File Selection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. As shown in the following, to help readers read, we provide a table of contents of the full paper.</p>
</div>
