<td id="A1.T12.2.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">about 0.9 days</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T12.2.21" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T12.2.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_b" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Training times on 50B tokens</th>
<td id="A1.T12.2.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">about 4.5 days</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
